  "title": "Jerry M NDE 4417",
  "date": "June 1978",
  "content": "My first experience in learning or hearing the same voices I heard and later engaged with during my Out of Body Experience, started when I was six years old. I was swimming in a lake with my younger brother who, upon our return from playing on a large navy raft in the lake, got tired and went under the water. He went under several times and no one was around. Neither of us swam well and I was not a good enough swimmer to help him. That is when the voices first spoke to me and told me how to save him, which I did. The next occurrence was in college. I was on a football scholarship and I began to hear the same voices (I refer to them as 'The Boys' and that is not a sexist remark that is simply how I refer to them). They spoke to me then and I was able to know things would happen before they did and I was accurate more often than not. I then had my out of body experience in 1978. I was not spoken to again until the late 1980's. That is when I went back to meditating and began my pursuit of other truths on this plane, eventually arriving at nature based spirituality as what settles as truth in my being. Stephen Hawking said, 'Too often we think of ourselves as human beings here for a spiritual experience, when the truth is, we ARE spirit beings, here simply for a human experience.' This quote I took into meditation and that is when I spoke with 'the boys' again and I was made privy to what I know to be the truth for me about why we are here.",
